; npm config for the frontend.
;
; @myraui/* packages are private and live in the GitLab npm registry on
; project 472 (software-engineering/engineering-common/myra-ui). The
; GITLAB_PACKAGE_TOKEN env var is injected by CI from a project-scoped
; deploy token with `read_package_registry`. Local dev either has this
; var set, or relies on the existing node_modules/@myraui/ install.
;
; npm 7+ substitutes ${VAR} from the environment at config load time.

@myraui:registry=https://scm.myra.security/api/v4/projects/472/packages/npm/
//scm.myra.security/api/v4/projects/472/packages/npm/:_authToken=${GITLAB_PACKAGE_TOKEN}
